#: ../../library/blueprints/layouts.rst:4
msgid ""
"Layouts are attached to Instance Types. A Layout can only be attached to "
"a single Instance Type and a single Technology. An Instance Type can have"
" one or many Layouts attached to it, allowing for a single Instance Type "
"to work with any Technology type. Node Types are added to Layouts. A "
"Layout can have one or many node types attached to it. Node types can be "
"shared across Layouts of matching Technology types."
msgstr "Layouts are attached to Types d'instance. A Layout can only be attached to a single Tipo de instance and a single Technology. An Tipo de instance can have one or many Layouts attached to it, allowing for a single Tipo de instance to work with any Technology type. Tipos de nœud are added to Layouts. A Layout can have one or many node types attached to it. Node types peut ser shared across Layouts of matching Technology types."

